# A character leaves and comes back: the picture and RefMod dials, case by case. Render segment 2 at
# seed 7, with one SET line in chunk 3 switched on at a time. The CAST does not describe Jinx, so
# whatever looks like her (blue braids, tattoos, the Arcane look) comes from a reference.
@h3 ref2va 2:3 0.6MP
style: live-action, TikTok reel
context: 22

CAST
JINX (refmod minimaxh3_jinx_v1_refmod, image 1): a skinny and pretty alternative young woman around 20 years old.

CHUNK 1
SHOT 7s: static
SEND: frame 30 to image 1
JINX is showcasing her outfit. JINX is wearing __80s/80s_women_clothing_combined__ and has __80s/80s_women_hair_combined__ and her hair is of __80s/colors/80s_colors__ color for a 80's party she is going. After 3s someone is ringing at the door and JINX goes looking and is leaving the scene to the side and is completely out of frame after 5s. After 5s the camera is filming an empty room.
HANDOFF: the camera is filming only the room.

CHUNK 2
SHOT 5s: static
The camera is filming a room. nothing is happening.
HANDOFF: the camera is filming only the room.

CHUNK 3
SHOT 7s: static
# A: neither: a young woman as the text describes her, nothing of Jinx
#SET: image_1(0), minimaxh3_jinx_v1_refmod(0)
# B: the RefMod alone: Jinx, but not the outfit of frame 30
#SET: image_1(0), minimaxh3_jinx_v1_refmod(1)
# C: the picture alone: as in frame 30, in its 80s outfit
#SET: image_1(1), minimaxh3_jinx_v1_refmod(0)
# D: both, as without SET
#SET: image_1(1), minimaxh3_jinx_v1_refmod(1)
# E: half the picture: between A and C? Its text encoder still sees it in full
#SET: image_1(0.5), minimaxh3_jinx_v1_refmod(0)
# F: half the RefMod: between A and B?
#SET: image_1(0), minimaxh3_jinx_v1_refmod(0.5)
# G: the picture from 35%: the framing free, the outfit still there?
#SET: image_1(1, 35%), minimaxh3_jinx_v1_refmod(0)
# H: the RefMod from 35%, the old default: in chunk 1 no Jinx came through at all
#SET: image_1(0), minimaxh3_jinx_v1_refmod(1, 35%)
# I: Jinx only in the first 10% of sampling, then the prompt takes over
#SET: image_1(0), minimaxh3_jinx_v1_refmod(1, 0%, 10%)
# J: Jinx in the first 30%
#SET: image_1(0), minimaxh3_jinx_v1_refmod(1, 0%, 30%)
# K (#61): the picture as good as gone from H3's attention, while its text encoder sees it in full.
# Like C: the text encoder carries the picture. Like A: the latents do.
# L (#61): the same SET with #63 installed, so its vision block in the text is at 0.01 too: what is
# left of Jinx then came through the prompt Qwen read after the picture. Render A, C and L with SLA off:
# a strength other than 1 runs dense anyway, a case at 1 would lose reference blocks to sparsity.
SET: image_1(0.01), minimaxh3_jinx_v1_refmod(0)
JINX is entering the scene from the side and standing in front of the camera. JINX is showcasing her outfit.
